{
  "name": "Human (Cro-Magnon): Coalition Tongue",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_music_5.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-human=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"The first thing worth defending was a circle of people who had decided, against all sense, to defend each other.\"</em></p><p><strong>Coalition Tongue (1/Soma Break).</strong> Bonus action — choose one ally within 6 squares who can hear and understand you. Their next attack roll, skill check, or defense check before the start of your next turn is made at +1 rank (max rank 5). Name the thing you said, even if it was wordless.</p><p><strong>Symbolic Memory (passive).</strong> After spending 10 minutes in any inhabited or formerly-inhabited space, ask the GM one of: <em>Who lived here? · What did they fear? · What did they leave?</em> The answer is at least one truth, even if the GM colours it.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"humCroMagnonCoalitionTongue\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Coalition Tongue + Symbolic Memory</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break + always-on passive  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Picker (Coalition Tongue · Symbolic Memory)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Bonus-action ally bump (+1 rank to next roll, max 5) and 10-min space-reading GM-info passive.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
